  "body": "\"Clear cookies\" for an origin _needs_ to wipe all storage for that origin; including service workers. \r\n\r\nLet's make a non-normative, but explicit note on this behavior for \"clear cookies\" in the spec.\r\n\r\nper [TAG discussion](https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/469#issuecomment-633875799)",
